er\"><div class=\"site-header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" width=\"44\" height=\"44\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav-wrap\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><div class=\"site-nav-desktop\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/team\">Team</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div><button class=\"site-nav-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open navigation menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"_R_4pb_\"><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-label\">Menu</span><span class=\"site-nav-toggle-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span></span><span></span></span></button><div id=\"_R_4pb_\" class=\"site-nav-mobile\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-inner\"><div class=\"site-nav-mobile-links\"><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/buy\"><span>Buy</span><span>01</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/sell\"><span>Sell</span><span>02</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/home-valuation\"><span>Home Valuation</span><span>03</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span>Communities</span><span>04</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/team\"><span>Team</span><span>05</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/about\"><span>About</span><span>06</span></a><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-link\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Contact</span><span>07</span></a></div><a class=\"site-nav-mobile-cta\" href=\"/home-valuation\">Get your home value <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></div></nav></div></header><main class=\"site-main\"><main class=\"community-detail-page\"><section class=\"community-detail-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"community-title\"><div class=\"community-detail-hero-content\"><a class=\"community-back-link\" href=\"/communities\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">←</span> All communities</a><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">Fox Cities communities / <!-- -->08</p><h1 id=\"community-title\">Oshkosh</h1><p class=\"community-detail-hero-copy\">Discover a community with a broad range of neighborhoods, housing possibilities, and a lifestyle that deserves close local attention.</p><div class=\"community-detail-hero-actions\"><a href=\"#buyers-sellers-guides\" class=\"btn btn--light\">Get the Buyer’s &amp; Seller’s Guides</a></div></div><figure class=\"community-hero-figure\"><div class=\"community-detail-hero-media\"><img alt=\"Downtown Oshkosh, Wisconsin.\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"community-detail-image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center;color:transparent\" src=\"/communities/oshkosh.jpg\"/></div><figcaption class=\"community-image-credit\"><a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:OKW.jpg\">OKW.jpg</a> — Photo by <span>Awanalore</span> / Wikimedia Commons / <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" rel=\"license\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a><span class=\"community-image-credit-changes\">Displayed cropped to fit the layout.</span></figcaption></figure></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-overview\" aria-labelledby=\"community-overview-title\"><div><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">01 — Local perspective</p><h2 id=\"community-overview-title\">Get to know <!-- -->Oshkosh<!-- -->.</h2></div><div class=\"community-detail-overview-copy\"><p>Oshkosh gives buyers and sellers many variables to weigh across different areas and property types. We help simplify the process by bringing clarity to market position, home condition, neighborhood context, and the choices in front of you.</p></div></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-market\" aria-labelledby=\"community-market-title\"><div class=\"community-detail-section-heading\"><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">02 — Market context</p><h2 id=\"community-market-title\">Oshkosh<!-- -->, by the numbers.</h2><p class=\"community-detail-section-copy\">Verified market figures will be added here. Until then, all statistics below are clearly marked as placeholders.</p></div><dl class=\"community-stat-grid\"><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Median sale price</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Average days on market</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Active listings</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Average price per sq. ft.</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div><div class=\"community-stat-card\"><dt>Year-over-year trend</dt><dd class=\"community-stat-value\">Coming soon</dd><dd class=\"community-stat-note\">Reporting period to be confirmed</dd></div></dl></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-properties\" aria-labelledby=\"community-properties-title\"><div class=\"community-detail-section-heading\"><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">03 — Properties</p><h2 id=\"community-properties-title\">A closer look at <!-- -->Oshkosh<!-- -->.</h2><p class=\"community-detail-section-copy\">Approved property photography will be added here. These placeholders do not represent active listings.</p></div><div class=\"community-property-grid\"><figure class=\"community-gallery-figure\"><div class=\"community-property-media\"><div class=\"community-media-placeholder\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"community-placeholder-mark\">L</span><p>Oshkosh property photo 01</p><span class=\"community-placeholder-note\">Image coming soon</span></div></div></figure><figure class=\"community-gallery-figure\"><div class=\"community-property-media\"><div class=\"community-media-placeholder\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"community-placeholder-mark\">L</span><p>Oshkosh property photo 02</p><span class=\"community-placeholder-note\">Image coming soon</span></div></div></figure><figure class=\"community-gallery-figure\"><div class=\"community-property-media\"><div class=\"community-media-placeholder\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"community-placeholder-mark\">L</span><p>Oshkosh property photo 03</p><span class=\"community-placeholder-note\">Image coming soon</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section id=\"buyers-sellers-guides\" class=\"guides-lead-magnet\" aria-labelledby=\"guides-lead-magnet-title\"><div class=\"guides-lead-magnet-content\"><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-eyebrow\">Plan your next chapter</p><h2 id=\"guides-lead-magnet-title\">Get the Buyer’s &amp; Seller’s Guides</h2><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-description\">Submit the form and we’ll send you practical guides to help you make your next move with confidence.</p><p class=\"guides-lead-magnet-delivery\">After submitting, you’ll see a thank-you message here and receive the guides by email.</p></div><div class=\"guides-lead-magnet-form\"><iframe src=\"https://api.leadconnectorhq.com/widget/form/c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;border:none;border-radius:8px\" id=\"inline-c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-layout=\"{&#x27;id&#x27;:&#x27;INLINE&#x27;}\" data-trigger-type=\"alwaysShow\" data-trigger-value=\"\" data-activation-type=\"alwaysActivated\" data-activation-value=\"\" data-deactivation-type=\"neverDeactivate\" data-deactivation-value=\"\" data-form-name=\"Buyer&#x27;s and Seller&#x27;s Guide\" data-height=\"989\" data-layout-iframe-id=\"inline-c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-form-id=\"c4gouupwAcYwlKn3nYNS\" data-cookie-consent=\"true\" data-cookie-consent-provider=\"auto\" title=\"Buyer&#x27;s and Seller&#x27;s Guide\"></iframe></div></section><section class=\"community-detail-section community-detail-final\" aria-labelledby=\"community-final-title\"><p class=\"community-detail-eyebrow\">Your next chapter</p><h2 id=\"community-final-title\">Let’s talk about your next move in Oshkosh.</h2><p class=\"community-detail-section-copy\">Buying, selling, or simply exploring? Talk with the Lathrop Team about your priorities and next steps.</p><a class=\"btn btn--light\" href=\"/contact\">Talk through your move</a></section></main><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"site-footer\"><div class=\"site-footer-top\"><div class=\"footer-brand\"><a class=\"site-logo\" aria-label=\"Lathrop Team Home\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"Lathrop Team logo\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/logos/1.jpg\"/><span class=\"site-logo-text\">Lathrop Team</span></a><p>A three-generation Fox Cities real estate team bringing local perspective, documented performance, and personal guidance to every move.</p><a class=\"footer-text-link\" href=\"/contact\">Start a conversation <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div><div class=\"footer-navigation\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Explore</p><div class=\"footer-nav-links\"><a href=\"/buy\">Buy</a><a href=\"/sell\">Sell</a><a href=\"/home-valuation\">Home Valuation</a><a href=\"/communities\">Communities</a><a href=\"/team\">Team</a><a href=\"/about\">About</a><a href=\"/contact\">Contact</a></div></div><div class=\"footer-contact\"><p class=\"footer-heading\">Direct contact</p><address><p><strong>Diane Lathrop</strong><a href=\"mailto:diane@lathropteam.com\">diane@lathropteam.com</a><a href=\"tel:+19204289227\">(9